Homepage: https://github.com/musqz/gparted-launch

Package: gparted-launch
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, gparted, yad, util-linux
Recommends: xorg-xhost
Description: Select a drive before GParted opens
 A lightweight GParted wrapper. GParted launched directly scans every
 connected block device at startup; this wrapper lets you pick the
 drive first, so GParted opens directly on that device only.
